# Testing Standards

- Test runner: Vitest (`happy-dom` for React); colocate tests next to source as `*.test.ts(x)`
- Use descriptive test names that read as sentences
- Every package must have tests
- Run `pnpm test` (all) or `pnpm --filter <name> test` (one package)
